    "text": "kalb.com\nwebsite\nGrant Parish\nEmployee arrested for trying to smuggle drugs into Federal Prison in Grant Parish\nBy KALB Digital Team,\n14 hours agoGRANT PARISH, La. (KALB) - A Federal Prison employee has been arrested for trying to smuggle drugs into the facility, according to the Grant Parish Sheriff’s Office. J’Alexis Alexander, 22, of Hessmer, was arrested for possession of fentanyl with the intent to distribute, possession of methamphetamine with the intent to distribute, taking contraband into a penal institution, possession of marijuana with the intent to distribute, possession of suboxone with the intent ot distribute and malfeasance in office.\n3",
